@arnov I actually thought exactly the same when answering on this issue, so I opened https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/25303 (but forgot to link to it here).

So I agree that `skipna` is more logical, but I don't think we can't simply change it as you did in https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/25304, we will have to deprecate the keyword and behaviour first.

Short term, I think it would be good to "just" fix it using `numeric_only` (so we can include this for 0.24.2), and then for 0.25.0 we could think about deprecating it. But let's first discuss that in https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/25303
